quot;!</h2>When Coneru gets in a great mood after certain conditions are met, she enters *RunRun Mode*! With insane, game-breaking speed and power, will you be able to keep up with her explosive excitement?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600700/extras/08b995e6aecf69cf525ccf9df7976f05.poster.avif?t=1754012832\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600700/extras/08b995e6aecf69cf525ccf9df7976f05.webm?t=1754012832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Conerun Talk&quot;: Endless Chatter!</h2>As you battle through this action-packed date, Coneru reacts to everything around with her  expressions. After all, this is a date! Why fight with a serious face when you can chat, smile, and slash enemies while laughing together?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600700/extras/f3e7eeb48a120e4f47f914ca165bdfac.avif?t=1754012832\" width=600 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Date to Remember</h2>In this game, your soul and Coneru\u2019s, two beings from different dimensions, unite as one. Embark on a special date that you can only experience in this unique 2D action adventure. It\u2019ll be a date you'll never forget!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600700/extras/c61a329a9914b1bb657a7c8105aa43cc.avif?t=1754012832\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>We\u2019re still hard at work! Keep an eye out for updates as we continue development.<br>Don\u2019t forget to add to your wishlist and follow us for the latest news!",
